{"id":"afccdc84d827162a","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-zfc-ideal-p-ideal.md","title":"ZFC Ideal P Ideal","display":"df-zfc-ideal-p-ideal — ZFC Ideal P Ideal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-ideal-p-ideal","aliases":["58-df-zfc-ideal-p-ideal","58-df-zfc-ideal6-p-ideal"],"display":"df-zfc-ideal-p-ideal — ZFC Ideal P Ideal","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-ideal.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-ideal-p-ideal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-ideal-p-ideal</span><span>58-df-zfc-ideal6-p-ideal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-ideal-p-ideal — ZFC Ideal P Ideal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6e4f95381faac4f9\" href=\"?note=6e4f95381faac4f9\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-ideal.md\">../batch05/58-df-ideal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I,\\langle A_n:n\\in\\omega\\rangle,B\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal I,\\langle A_n:n\\in\\omega\\rangle,B\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ideal}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ideal}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6e4f95381faac4f9\" href=\"?note=6e4f95381faac4f9\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-ideal.md\">../batch05/58-df-ideal.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcIdealPIdeal}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcIdeal6PIdeal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcIdealPIdeal}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcIdeal6PIdeal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[A]^{&lt;\\omega}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):\\mathrm{Finite}(B)\\}\">\\([A]^{&lt;\\omega}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):\\mathrm{Finite}(B)\\}\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|\">\\(|A|\\)</span> 为集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的唯一基数，使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a> 的基数函数。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}p\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcIdealPIdeal}_S(\\mathcal I) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ideal}(\\mathcal I,\\mathcal P(\\omega))\\land\\omega\\notin\\mathcal I\\land[\\omega]^{&lt;\\omega}\\subseteq\\mathcal I\\land\\forall\\langle A_n:n\\in\\omega\\rangle\\in\\mathcal I^\\omega\\;\\exists B\\in\\mathcal I\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(|A_n\\setminus B|&lt;\\omega)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}p\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcIdealPIdeal}_S(\\mathcal I) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ideal}(\\mathcal I,\\mathcal P(\\omega))\\land\\omega\\notin\\mathcal I\\land[\\omega]^{&lt;\\omega}\\subseteq\\mathcal I\\land\\forall\\langle A_n:n\\in\\omega\\rangle\\in\\mathcal I^\\omega\\;\\exists B\\in\\mathcal I\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(|A_n\\setminus B|&lt;\\omega)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}p\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcIdeal6PIdeal}_S(\\mathcal I)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcIdealPIdeal}_S(\\mathcal I)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}p\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcIdeal6PIdeal}_S(\\mathcal I)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcIdealPIdeal}_S(\\mathcal I)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The ideal is proper and contains all finite subsets of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>, as required by the standard P-ideal convention.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-ideal.md","status":"resolved","id":"6e4f95381faac4f9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-ideal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor